+---
+id: dl-003-invalid-input-is-rejected-with-an-invalid-input-error
+type: decision-log
+title: "Invalid input is rejected with an invalid-input error"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- decision-log body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+## Context
+
+Screens pass raw user input to the list. Bad titles, priorities and tags must be refused with a clear
+error, and the list must stay unchanged (r4: the domain returns a Result, never throws).
+
+## Decision
+
+Add the error code `invalid-input` and validate in `add`, `rename` and `tag` before any lookup or
+store. The title limit of 120 applies to the trimmed title. A tag is not trimmed: whitespace anywhere in it
+is rejected. The first problem found is reported.
+
+## Consequences
+
+`TodoErrorCode` gains a member, which callers switching on it must handle. Validation lives in
+`src/domain/validation.ts`.
